    attribute :>> anchor="call_sfun_with_cleanup;___call_sfun;___sfun_error;___END_SFUN;___propagate_error";
    attribute :>> invariant="A throw from ___call carries explicit control origin through both SFUN sites. All three generated families skip conversion recovery for thrown control, execute existing cleanup and propagate the unchanged status. Declarations and function-table signatures migrate with the wrappers. Reaching a Scheme continuation can precede physical C return: still-active callback banks remain roots across GC until their own unwind. Never restore an obsolete Scheme frame or prematurely drop its bank.";
